&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Established in 2004, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;OLIVER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; is the world’s first and only specialist in designing, building, and running bespoke in-house agencies and marketing ecosystems for brands. We partner with over 300 clients in 40+ countries and counting. Our unique model drives creativity and efficiency, allowing us to deliver tailored solutions that resonate deeply with audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a part of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Brandtech Group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, we&#39;re at the forefront of leveraging cutting-edge AI technology to revolutionise how we create and deliver work. Our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;AI solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; enhance efficiency, spark creativity, and drive insightful decision-making, empowering our teams to produce innovative and impactful results.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;Campaign Marketing Manager &lt;strong&gt;(12 Month FTC)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Location: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;London, United Kingdom &lt;strong&gt;(3 days a week from Client Canary Wharf offices)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW84858281 BCX0&quot;&gt;Our client has&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW84858281 BCX0&quot;&gt;a hybrid working experience that blends the positives of working alongside colleagues at onsite locations, together with working from home. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW84858281 BCX0&quot;&gt;That means &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW84858281 BCX0&quot;&gt;you’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW84858281 BCX0&quot;&gt; work at an onsite location on fixed, ‘anchor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW84858281 BCX0&quot;&gt;’,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW84858281 BCX0&quot;&gt; days of the week, for a minimum of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW84858281 BCX0&quot;&gt;three&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW84858281 BCX0&quot;&gt; days a week&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW84858281 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW84858281 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW84858281 BCX0&quot;&gt;For this role, you could work in any of the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW84858281 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;offices, including Canary Wharf, Northampton, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW84858281 BCX0&quot;&gt;Glasgow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW84858281 BCX0&quot;&gt; or Cardiff&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW84858281 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced Campaign Marketing Manager to join our client team on a 12-month fixed-term contract, working directly within their B2C Performance team across a range of multi-channel campaigns and projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll hit the ground running in a fast-paced, deadline-driven environment — leading and delivering multi-variant marketing comms across paid and owned digital channels. From mining customer and performance insights to delivering final assets and reviewing results, you&#39;ll own the process end to end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;You&#39;re a highly collaborative self-starter, skilled at juggling multiple projects and managing senior stakeholders in regulated environments. Experience across paid and owned channels — including video, display, social, email, and OOH — is essential. A background in Financial Services is a plus; experience in telecoms, utilities, or similarly regulated industries is equally welcome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;Creating and producing brilliantly effective campaigns that differentiate the client from their competitors, through superior targeting, communication strategy, tech innovation &amp;amp; creative quality&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;Working collaboratively with the wider Marketing Centre of Excellence to ensure communications are on product message, customer focused, developed in line with brand guidelines, aligned to brand values, adhere to regulatory requirements and developed in line with relevant governance frameworks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;Effectively managing budgets to maximise return on investment and drive commercial performance, as measured by solutions growth and cost per acquisition&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;Keeping campaigns on time and to plan, regardless of the curved balls that you might experience along the way&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;Working collaboratively with business stakeholders to develop clear roadmaps and testing designs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;Managing relationships with the UK Digital, Product &amp;amp; Marketing teams, as well as various external agency partners&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;Leading the campaign delivery lifecycle – from ideation/discovery, through planning &amp;amp; prioritization, to solution design and in-channel execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;Reporting on campaign performance and testing outcomes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;Being genuinely collaborative, inside and outside the team, to help make the Performance Marketing team a great place to work&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;Fostering strong and meaningful relationships with key stakeholders by maintaining a regular dialogue, keeping them informed on all key milestones and outcomes, with clear recommendations to drive performance uplift&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;Raising any issues in a timely and rational manner, ensuring the highest standards of control &amp;amp; governance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;Being a self-starter, able to bring proactive opportunities and solutions to key stakeholders, as opposed to waiting for direction&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;Sharing experience from a customer-driven organisation with a customer first mindset&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;Taking ownership for managing risk and strengthening controls in relation to the work you do&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;Ensuring high levels of accuracy across all comms and ensuring that QA is never compromised&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
