&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Backend Engineer, you will design, implement, and evolve product capabilities while solving high-scope backend problems and influencing the technical and product direction of our teams. You will move beyond &quot;assigned work&quot; to actively improve the quality, reliability, and performance of our systems. You will work across product, frontend, infrastructure, data, and security boundaries, making sound architectural trade-offs, communicating complex ideas clearly in an asynchronous environment, and helping define the standards for a high-scale, global product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you’ll love this role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Impact: &lt;/strong&gt;You aren&#39;t just shipping features; you are shaping the architecture of a global platform used by millions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Agency: &lt;/strong&gt;You will influence team objectives, technical direction, and long-range goals, helping us solve problems of high scope and complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovative Culture: &lt;/strong&gt;You will get to experiment with and integrate agentic AI into production engineering workflows, moving beyond simple prompt engineering to build resilient, AI-assisted systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomy: &lt;/strong&gt;You will thrive in our remote-first, asynchronous organization, where clear written communication and self-direction are the pillars of success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;User-Centric Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll partner closely with PMs and designers to shape requirements, ensuring every technical decision delivers genuine value to our users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Technical Direction: &lt;/strong&gt;Design and ship moderate to complex backend features with minimal guidance, making pragmatic choices between modular-monolith code, shared components, or independently operated services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the Bar: &lt;/strong&gt;Advocate for product quality, security, availability, and performance. You will define backend standards for style, maintainability, testing, APIs, and operational readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor &amp;amp; Lead: &lt;/strong&gt;Mentor associate and intermediate engineers, remove technical blockers, and improve team delivery practices through code and design reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence: &lt;/strong&gt;Diagnose and prevent performance/reliability issues at scale. Participate in incident response and act as a technical owner where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Integration: &lt;/strong&gt;Use AI in production engineering work to improve outcomes, evaluate its effectiveness, and coach others on responsible, high-judgment use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Backend Expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;A strong command of backend architecture, APIs, data systems, and performance tuning in a complex product or service environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability: &lt;/strong&gt;Proficiency in modern backend languages and a deep understanding of systems programming. We value the ability to learn and adapt over mastery of a single language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architectural Judgment: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience designing or evolving modular backend boundaries, bounded contexts, and migration-safe architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence: &lt;/strong&gt;Ability to lead through influence, technical judgment, and clear written communication, effectively bridging the gap between product needs and technical reality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic AI Expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven experience building or operating agentic systems in production—moving beyond prompt engineering to architecting loops, tool-use, and error-handling strategies that ensure reliability at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Helpful experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with high-throughput distributed systems, concurrency, or profiling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with containerized production operations (e.g., Kubernetes).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep database performance knowledge (e.g., PostgreSQL, ClickHouse, schema evolution, partitioning).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in large-scale modular monoliths or event-driven systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Public technical communication, open-source maintenance, or experience in developer-focused SaaS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
